{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-bottom-cost#card-zh","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-bottom-cost","commit":"41abd0651fdc83a7ae7184ca5e85b8e4fe7323ef","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bottom-cost 是 DeepSeek Harness 网页端的会话费用插件，在输入框下方统计栏显示费用胶囊。它通过会话投影按轮整理模型调用的 token，再按当前价目表在浏览器计算费用。面板展示每轮花费、缓存命中与未命中金额、总额及未计价调用，并可跳转到对应轮次；用户也能手动刷新官方 DeepSeek 价目页、查看变化后选择采用。适合想核对 DeepSeek 对话 token 费用的 DSH 用户；其他 provider 显示未计价。无需 API key，刷新价目时才请求官方定价页面。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-15","lib/fold.js:199-223","lib/pricebook-store.js:80-103"]}
{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-bottom-cost#card-en","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-bottom-cost","commit":"41abd0651fdc83a7ae7184ca5e85b8e4fe7323ef","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-bottom-cost adds a cost chip below the composer in DSH web. It estimates per-turn CNY costs from token usage, showing cache-hit and cache-miss amounts. Users can refresh the official DeepSeek price page, review and apply changes. Other providers are unpriced; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-15","lib/fold.js:199-223","lib/pricebook-store.js:80-103"]}
