{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-bottom-cost#feature-1","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-bottom-cost","commit":"41abd0651fdc83a7ae7184ca5e85b8e4fe7323ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bottom-cost 的功能「逐轮费用统计」：在输入框下方展示会话总费用和各轮费用，并拆分缓存命中与未命中部分。点击轮次标签可定位到对话中相应轮次。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-15","lib/fold.js:190-223"]}
