{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-bottom-cost#feature-3","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-bottom-cost","commit":"41abd0651fdc83a7ae7184ca5e85b8e4fe7323ef","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bottom-cost 的功能「刷新并采用价目」：用户从面板触发刷新，插件抓取并解析 DeepSeek 官方中文定价页，展示候选价目与变化；用户选择采用后，价目保存到 DSH 家目录并用于重算费用。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/pricebook-store.js:76-103","lib/pricebook-store.js:106-125","lib/client.js:9-15"]}
