{"unit_id":"LanFeng97__dsh-bottom-cost#caveat-2","repo":"LanFeng97/dsh-bottom-cost","commit":"41abd0651fdc83a7ae7184ca5e85b8e4fe7323ef","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-bottom-cost 仅在用户触发刷新时请求 api-docs.deepseek.com；采用的价目表写入 DSH 家目录的 dsh-bottom-cost/pricebook.json。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/pricebook-store.js:80-103","lib/pricebook-store.js:110-125"]}
